        <h2 id="RFM-%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B0%D0%BB%D0%B8%D0%B7(price)">RFM анализ(price)<a class="anchor-link" href="#RFM-%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B0%D0%BB%D0%B8%D0%B7(price)">¶</a></h2>
