        <h2 id="%D0%A1%D0%BE%D0%B7%D0%B4%D0%B0%D0%B5%D1%82-stacked-bar-chart-%D0%BF%D0%BE%D0%BA%D0%B0%D0%B7%D1%8B%D0%B2%D0%B0%D1%8E%D1%89%D1%83%D1%8E-%D1%80%D0%B0%D1%81%D0%BF%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%B4%D0%B5%D0%BB%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%B5-RFM_Score-%D0%BF%D0%BE-%D0%BA%D0%B0%D0%B6%D0%B4%D0%BE%D0%BC%D1%83-Segment.">Создает stacked bar chart показывающую распределение RFM_Score по каждому Segment.<a class="anchor-link" href="#%D0%A1%D0%BE%D0%B7%D0%B4%D0%B0%D0%B5%D1%82-stacked-bar-chart-%D0%BF%D0%BE%D0%BA%D0%B0%D0%B7%D1%8B%D0%B2%D0%B0%D1%8E%D1%89%D1%83%D1%8E-%D1%80%D0%B0%D1%81%D0%BF%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%B4%D0%B5%D0%BB%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%B5-RFM_Score-%D0%BF%D0%BE-%D0%BA%D0%B0%D0%B6%D0%B4%D0%BE%D0%BC%D1%83-Segment.">¶</a></h2>
      </div>
